  "result": "Done! Added comprehensive date utility functions to handle all date operations in UTC:\n\n**New module - src/dates.js:**\n\n1. **isValidDate(text)** \n   - Validates YYYY-MM-DD format\n   - Checks date validity (rejects Feb 30, invalid months, etc.)\n   - Rejects non-string input\n   - Handles leap years correctly\n\n2. **addDays(date, n)**\n   - Adds n days to a date string (n can be negative)\n   - Returns new date in YYYY-MM-DD format\n   - Handles month/year boundaries seamlessly\n   - Throws on invalid input format\n\n3. **daysBetween(a, b)**\n   - Calculates whole days between two dates (b - a)\n   - Returns negative for dates in reverse order\n   - Returns 0 for same date\n   - Throws on invalid input format\n\n**Key features:**\n- All date arithmetic performed in UTC (no timezone issues)\n- Uses Date.UTC() to avoid local timezone conversion\n- Returns dates in strict YYYY-MM-DD format\n- Comprehensive error handling\n\n**Updated createInvoice():**\n- Now uses isValidDate from dates module\n- Removed duplicate validation logic\n\n**Tests added:** 22 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Valid/invalid formats\n- Non-existent dates (Feb 30, etc.)\n- Leap year handling (both leap and non-leap years)\n- Month and year boundaries\n- Large date differences\n- Edge cases and error conditions\n\n**Test results:** \u2705 All 128 tests pass (106 existing + 22 new)",
